    "Home",
    "About us",
    "We are your partner for comprehensive digitalization. Together, we shape the digital transformation and take your company to the next level – tailored to your individual requirements, goals, and strategies. Since 2024, we have been part of the Dutch-based Conclusion Group, forming a European powerhouse for digital experience and business transformation.",
    "With over 20 years of experience and deep industry expertise, we understand the challenges that companies must face today and in the future. Because we think beyond standard solutions. Because we know that we achieve the best results with passion. Because we put the passion in transaction.",
    "We accompany you from planning to operation. By optimizing the integration of our internal expertise, covering the entire customer journey, and adopting a holistic approach, we ensure efficiency and your success. We understand the importance of the right technology and assist with selection and implementation.",
    "We are more than 900 specialists and partners with the expertise and the vision to drive your digital future. As experts for end-to-end digital commerce we are aware of market developments and evaluate relevant industry trends for you. Your unique solution will transparently be managed and implemented by a single source – from the start to the objective set together.",
    "Technology drives growth - which is measurable. We can help you to screen your business and offer a transparent scope to enable the expansion of your company. We know how to inspire your customers through personalised experiences; driven by data, creativity and passion; measured by more transactions and an increasing number of loyal customers.",
    "Your business success depends on successful transactions with your customers. That's why we create experiences that help you attract, delight, and retain customers - and achieve measurable increases in revenue, competitive advantages, and successful transactions starting today. Customized to fit your individual processes and business strategy.",
    "diva-e Conclusion stands for certified information security. We are ISO 27001 certified and protect data in accordance with international standards – reliably, transparently, and with continuous improvement.",
    "With the TISAX® Level 2 label (security requirement “Info high”) and maturity level 3, we also meet the high security requirements of the automotive industry. This enables us to offer our customers maximum security and trust.",
    "Mr.",
